# Minimal placeholder for altunelyusuf/SemanticTechnologies@bad0fa7c46's
# landscape/02-ontology/semtech_tbox_v6_2_0.ttl (see this region's
# meta.json / context_predecl.py). This region's own two lines
# (`for s_, p_, d_ in en.NEW_RELATIONS: g2.add((IRI[s_], SEM[p_], IRI[d_]))`)
# only ADD triples to g2 -- they never read the graph's pre-existing
# content -- so the real ~1000-triple tbox file's actual content cannot
# affect this region's correctness. A single triple stands in for it.
